Applied by tools/build_hactool.py after mbedtls-asm-clobbers.patch. Ours: an input can be a byte range of a bigger
file. HACTOOL_INPUT_RANGE and HACTOOL_BASENCA_RANGE ("<offset>:<size>", decimal bytes) make hactool read the update
and base Program NCAs where they lie inside the player's NSP files, so the RomFS merge of the launcher's install wizard
(kit-tools/s3_merge.py --in-place) no longer copies them out first: 12 GB less written and 12 GB less free space needed
for Splatoon 3 11.2.0. Every seek goes through range_fseeko64 (utils.h); without the variables nothing changes.
